---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="">
<Verticalgrid />
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl py-24 lg:px-16 md:px-12 px-8 xl:px-18 items-center lg:py-24 relative w-full">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="mt-8">Flawless Integration across both In-store and Online Platforms.</h2>
      <p class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-4">99minds streamlines your marketing efforts across all your channels. It integrates seamlessly with your Point-of-Sale and eCommerce systems, ensuring a unified workflow with a compelling gifting experience and customer loyalty</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-16">
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Square gift cards" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-GC.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Ultimate Gifting Experience- Physical and eGift cards</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">99minds enables customers to purchase, send, and customize branded Gift Cards both in-store and online. By integrating with Square POS, users can issue omnichannel gift cards, providing a seamless and intuitive approach to enhance sales and foster loyalty.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
          
        
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt=" Square loyalty program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-LP.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Efficient and Dynamic Loyalty Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Introduce an omnichannel loyalty program that enhances customer lifetime value and improves marketing outcomes.      99minds integrates effortlessly with the Square POS system, enabling businesses to incentivize repeat customers, monitor visits and expenditures, and provide customized rewards and discounts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
     
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Square referral program" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-Rf.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8">Customisable Referral Program</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Build a referral program that turns customer advocacy to revenue driver through SMS, emails, social media and more.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
       
      </div>
     
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
        <div class="px-6 py-8 sm:p-10 sm:pb-6">
          <div class="grid items-center justify-center w-full grid-cols-1 text-left">
            <div>
              <img alt="Square POS" class="text-center" width="176" height="176" loading="lazy" src="/assets/shopify/Shopify-POS.svg">
              <h3 class="mt-8 ">Seamless POS Integration</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 ">Discover the perfect retail synergy as 99minds effortlessly integrates with your POS system, streamlining your business's retail management.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
    </div>
  </div>
   <div class="flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl gap-2 mx-auto mt-16 sm:flex-row">
          <a href="https://giftcard.99minds.io/access/register" target="_blank" class="raise1 relative p-0.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center font-bold overflow-hidden group rounded-md font-medium">
                <span class="w-full h-full bg-black absolute"></span>
                <span class="relative px-4 py-2 transition-all ease-out bg-gray-900 bg-opacity-0 rounded-md group-hover:bg-opacity-10 duration-400">
                <span class="relative text-white">Install 99minds for free</span>
                </span>
          </a>
      </div>
</section>
